{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick any button on your keyboard or controller to make your bottle jump through obstacle-filled levels. Just don't use too much power, or your bottle will CRACK!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Reach the cauldron  without breaking yourself!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/extras/565c493e0e7cbe759a58a86d5c5bbc2c.poster.avif?t=1774283865\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/extras/565c493e0e7cbe759a58a86d5c5bbc2c.webm?t=1774283865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/extras/565c493e0e7cbe759a58a86d5c5bbc2c.mp4?t=1774283865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo &amp; Party Mode:</strong> Play alone or with any number of friends in local games. Since each player only needs one button, there\u2019s no limit to how many can join.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/extras/42c1f9b0dca71766787214c175fe1309.poster.avif?t=1774283865\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/extras/42c1f9b0dca71766787214c175fe1309.webm?t=1774283865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/extras/42c1f9b0dca71766787214c175fe1309.mp4?t=1774283865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong> Create or join public or private rooms with up to 12 players at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/extras/515b19b9317f12d029aa0290e7145a5c.poster.avif?t=1774283865\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/extras/515b19b9317f12d029aa0290e7145a5c.webm?t=1774283865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/extras/515b19b9317f12d029aa0290e7145a5c.mp4?t=1774283865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barrier Mode:</strong> Move together while avoiding obstacles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall of Fire:</strong> A wall of fire chases the players. If it catches everyone, the level restarts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Mode (Online Mode):</strong> Race against others with the camera following your bottle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom options:</strong> Disable checkpoints, timers, or player collisions for unique challenge.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> Unlock cosmetics for bottle trails and explosions, collect different bottle models by achieving in-game milestones, and earn emotes for the emote wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the chaos, compete with friends, and see if you don't make your BOTTLE CRACKS!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982830?t=1774283865","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/38c7bb6e212a52f42d9555781a1f66f632ef4d70/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774283865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/dc88cb8624d45268519772f42d17b22277aae4ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774283865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/dc88cb8624d45268519772f42d17b22277aae4ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774283865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4322390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick any button on your keyboard or controller to make your bottle jump through obstacle-filled levels. Just don't use too much power, or your bottle will CRACK!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Reach the cauldron  without breaking yourself!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/extras/565c493